2009/9/15  <m3o@plasmatix.com>:
> Hello, I am new to this mailing list and also to Lojban.

ui fi'i lo cnino
( [happiness] welcome newcomer )

mi'e la tijlan
( i'm tijlan )


Translation:

> You forget everything you knew.

do tolmo'i ro lo pu se djuno be do


> You lose all your knowledge, all your memories, your intentions,

.i do cirko ro lo do selju'o jo'u selmo'i jo'u terzu'e


> and thus are open for all the influences that await you in your environment.

seri'a lo nu tolri'u fi ro lo nu xlura poi balvi va'o lo do moi


> You don't know that you have forgotten,

.i do na'e sanji lo du'u do ba'o tolmo'i


> and therefore you don't feel any grief about it.

seri'a lo nu do ra na'esai badri


